0 HEAD
1 SOUR gedcom-go
2 VERS 1.0.0
2 NAME gedcom-go test suite
1 GEDC
2 VERS 5.5.1
2 FORM LINEAGE-LINKED
1 CHAR UTF-8
1 NOTE Level overflow test file.
2 CONT Original work for issue #301. The GEDCOM level field is at most two
2 CONT digits, so 99 is the deepest valid level. Line with level 100 is
2 CONT spec-invalid but below the parser's MaxNestingDepth of 100; the line
2 CONT with level 101 exceeds MaxNestingDepth and is rejected outright.
0 @I1@ INDI
1 NAME Level /Overflow/
1 NOTE anchor
100 CONT level one hundred
101 CONT level one hundred one
0 TRLR
